{"-ms-align-items is not a valid IE10/11 flexbox property (the correct one is -ms-flex-align), keeping the invalid property can trip CSS linters and adds noise": 0.4601699411869049, "@mixin order sets -webkit-box-ordinal-group/-moz-box-ordinal-group to the same value as the modern order, but in the legacy flexbox spec box-ordinal-group is 1-based (default 1), so it should be order + 1; otherwise items will be mis-ordered in browsers that still honor the prefixed properties": 0.8094494342803955, "align-items:$alignment is missing the usual spacing": 0.04395293816924095, ".small-action is now a flex container, but .small-action-desc doesn't flex to fill remaining space. Since float is ignored on flex items, the trailing button will no longer be pushed to the right unless the description grows (or the button is auto-margined)": 0.7772630453109741}